{
  "name": "herobot-classic",
  "$note": "An original hero robot boy in the late-platformer toy-hero language (about 4.4 heads tall): the herobot proportions, a youthful face with a pointed chin, and the robot as adornment DATA on the anime head. A face-window helm (cheek guards curled under the jaw, a back tucked round to the nape, ear domes, the window's top edge a raised V down to the bridge of the nose, its lines carried on as embossed stripes over the crown to the nape, a gem in the V), and fluff-style VOLUMES on the rig for the girth contrast: ball pauldrons on the upper arms, a moulded barrel chest plate with a cuff rim, a collar, wide dark briefs with a belt, football forearms flaring to cuffs at the wrist, boot cones flaring wide at the ankle, pointed half-egg feet; the herobot body's big puffed cartoon hands. Moulded plastic is the gloss highlight on the armour groups. No held gear; the arm cannon is still to come.",
  "$thesis": "a friendly hero robot boy: big helmeted head, girth contrast (wide forearms, flared boots), blue/cyan roles, one signature: the buster",
